The ASK meta-brand public landing site — a reference implementation of the
ASK design family.

This product vendors foundations, two patterns, five visual rules with one
optional helper, the spectral-state primitive the CFW mind map carries, and the
canonical browser-icon set from design-system-ASK
(github.com/apexSolarKiss/design-system-ASK):
  - colors_and_type.css        — canonical tokens (Tier 1 + Tier 2)
  - fonts/                      — Inter + JetBrains Mono variable webfonts (OFL; see fonts/*-OFL.txt)
  - assets/logo-ASK.*          — the logo-ASK wordmark (ASK Tier 3)
  - surface-shell.css          — the surface-shell pattern: the shared page
                                 shell, vendored as a pinned byte-identical
                                 copy and not modified here
  - surface-panel.css          — the shared visual contract for live content
                                 panels, vendored as a pinned byte-identical
                                 copy and not modified here. Presentation
                                 only: it owns no markup and no semantics
  - spectral-state.css         — the spectral-state primitive, vendored as a
                                 pinned byte-identical copy and not modified
                                 here. It is carried by the CFW mind map at
                                 apex-solar-kiss/consciousness-free-will/map/,
                                 which requires its governed-state custom
                                 properties
  - diagram-interactive-radial — the interactive radial pattern that draws
                                 the CFW mind map, in
                                 apex-solar-kiss/consciousness-free-will/:
                                 diagrams-radial.css, diagrams-radial-contract.js,
                                 -layout.js, -labels.js, -engine.js, -legend.js,
                                 -chrome.js, -inspector.js, -facets.js,
                                 -export.js and -theme.js; diagrams-pointer.js,
                                 the generated mirror of the shared pointer
                                 controller; and diagrams-fit.js, the shared
                                 diagram fit helper, which the pattern's engine
                                 loads to fit the map clear of the chrome each
                                 panel declares. All are vendored from one
                                 design-system-ASK commit as pinned
                                 byte-identical copies and not modified here.
                                 The map's adapter, instance and page layer
                                 (cfw-map-adapter.js, cfw-map.js, cfw-map.css)
                                 are this site's code, not vendored
  - surface-action.css         — the shared compact-action visual contract,
                                 vendored as a pinned byte-identical copy and
                                 not modified here. It owns the base surface,
                                 foreground, border, geometry and interaction;
                                 the consuming surface keeps the element
                                 semantics, destination, copy, row and
                                 placement. Its attention edge is also taken
                                 by class on the gallery cards and thumbnails,
                                 video facades, p5 launch cards and gallery
                                 dialog controls, for hover and keyboard focus
                                 only
  - surface-text-link.css      — the shared unboxed-textual-link contract,
                                 vendored as a pinned byte-identical copy and
                                 not modified here. It is OPT-IN BY CLASS: only
                                 an element carrying `.surface-text-link` takes
                                 it, and it is scoped to unboxed textual
                                 traversal — shaped controls, marks, figures,
                                 panels and image links are excluded. It owns
                                 rest, hover, active and focus presentation and
                                 deliberately sets NO foreground: the
                                 contextual text colour remains this site's to
                                 choose, supplied by the consuming region
  - surface-document.css       — the shared document register, vendored as a
                                 pinned byte-identical copy and not modified
                                 here. Presentation only: text roles, the space
                                 between them, the hierarchy rail, quotation
                                 and structured text. The CFW conclusions page at
                                 apex-solar-kiss/consciousness-free-will/
                                 consumes the full register. The apex solar
                                 kiss, asymptotic system key and studioLeoV
                                 pages consume its document-body and
                                 authored-inline-emphasis treatment in their
                                 opening paragraphs. The apex solar kiss,
                                 design, design portfolio project, ASKproduKtion
                                 and studioLeoV pages set
                                 their section headings in its section-title
                                 role, the bonAmi.ai portfolio page sets its
                                 feature headings in its subsection-title role,
                                 and the asymptotic system key page sets the
                                 Like Art founding statement, and the cryptoEATS
                                 portfolio page its tagline, as a quotation
  - surface-treatments.css     — the shared surface treatments, vendored as a
                                 pinned byte-identical copy and not modified
                                 here. Presentation only; the CFW conclusions
                                 page consumes its surface axes, emphasis rail
                                 and label, the asymptotic system key page and
                                 its lineage page its disclosure, for six
                                 sections each, and the
                                 CFW mind map its controlled disclosure
                                 trigger, for the inspector's collapse control
                                 and the About and Legend triggers used where
                                 the canvas cannot hold its caption and legend
                                 open
  - surface-document-overflow.js
                               — the document register's optional overflow-cue
                                 helper, vendored as a pinned byte-identical
                                 copy and not modified here. It reports whether
                                 a preformatted block, or a document table's
                                 scroll box, is wider than its box, and on which
